  "architecture": {
    "title": "Three workflows, one shape — Jev judges, code selects, a person decides",
    "caption": "Leads, RAG passages and BMS points all follow the same pattern: authorized input, typed judgments from Jev, a deterministic policy in code, and a proposal for a person. The RAG filter can only narrow an already access-filtered set; the point mapper never writes the graph.",
    "lanes": [
